Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

If you use aes_string() instead of aes(), you can do it.

Notice how these give the same result:

> aes(x = weight)
List of 1
 $ x: symbol weight

> xname <- "weight"
> aes_string(x = xname)
List of 1
 $ x: symbol weight

-Winston

