Hi Ahmed-

With the latest version of ggplot2, opts() and theme_?() are out of date, or deprecated. Use the replacements the messages suggest: replace “opt” in your code with “theme”, and replace “theme_text” with “element_text”.  Should work…the book was based on earlier versions of the package.

cheers,

Lori

